# No GitHub to outsiders — LOCKED

Never put a GitHub, `raw.githubusercontent.com`, git-repo, document-store,
or portfolio URL in anything Plaintiff will send or file: covering emails,
letters, stipulations, pleadings, proofs of service, or attachments' visible
text.

- Attach the PDF or Word. Do not "point them at" a link.
- Do not paste `github.com/newanforbi/...` or any other repo path.
- A download link in the agent chat for **him** is fine. It does not go in
  the email.
- If a draft already has a repo URL, strip it before he sends. Do not
  leave it "just this once."

